{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4/events","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4","id":6112227895,"node_id":"I_kwDOVESuUM8AAAABbFEyNw","number":4,"title":"Runtime gates fail on QEMU 10.0.13: virtio-net queue size is 1024, check requires 256.","user":{"login":"hafid-logic","id":266947999,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-lNnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266947999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic","html_url":"https://github.com/hafid-logic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-10-30T02:42:53Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:31:21Z","closed_at":"2026-11-02T00:31:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi Gregory,\n\nI ran an independent review of Ginux at commit d11c126a (with AI-assisted analysis, under my direction) and found one reproducible issue I thought worth sharing first.\n\nOn QEMU v10.0.13 (Debian), all runtime gates fail at boot because verify_network_queue_rejections requires receive_queue_size == 256, while the device reports 1024. In the QEMU source, virtio_add_queue in v10.0.13 forces queue_size = VIRTQUEUE_MAX_SIZE (\"Always set to max queue size for qemu <11.1\"); v10.0.10, v10.0.12 and v10.1.0 honor the requested size (256). Setting rx_queue_size=256 has no effect on v10.0.13.\n\nThe functional init path accepts any power of two >= 8, so only the calibration assertion fails. Possible fixes: pin/check the QEMU version in make doctor, or accept a range in that assertion.\n\nThanks for the open-source work,\n[Abdelhafid DJIDEL]","closed_by":{"login":"hafid-logic","id":266947999,"node_id":"U_kgDOD-lNnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/266947999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic","html_url":"https://github.com/hafid-logic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hafid-logic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/4/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"